    {
      "id": "6653cc65-2cd9-4777-8fb4-cb7ee79b3681",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e observe o papel do marcador na frase.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "db02e02a-0b0d-41ec-b882-f7b9904de44d",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Al principio</strong> abre a fase inicial da história.</p><p>Depois dele, a frase costuma descrever contexto, rotina ou hábito daquela etapa, e não um resultado final isolado.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "34b61354-2938-4057-802b-334d28ffd062",
      "title": "Escute a frase e observe como a história avanca sem parecer um evento repentino.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "ad92c52d-612c-41cd-9918-e8e8da8bb1d7",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora entra a mudanca gradual.</p><p><strong>Con el tiempo, fui ganando seguridad al hablar.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Com o tempo, fui ganhando seguranca ao falar.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/d0cbcbc98b9f4f5da696fd30eb9eb9db_l03b02-learning-timeline-realistic.png?Expires=1794099679&Signature=t6PUxdR59k-~EHD4qhRma1O4ur7eg5Wds09AESBI7G3PkXd~8X2rkPRqaR7rscbVHeGKdrgYwy7wr1x7pXtVZ5KNYUcbXRyjR9Uz~tl7vC4KFcOK8rThYqvLmXYBhPvP1Y9lg9he3C8dnF32jxziwjljs58qGS7zMDO2Si3fIhi~RW~57gamgagHHptYLVvYdbWc4He36E7BH23QY6m8VtEhW99FKnEw3OmdV59gCpr9sD64ZPrXhqmCkq4BMgH-gLkoUkTSXiWUGk9~KrIq6rp-PykY6PVif4OSPC-Mr2iHu0zPL1IgZ4lyYFfLTcuabIZIHkyk4SebETl32vLZRQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/65cef558e1d64a099c1fb16d5d4d6b78_l03b04-con-el-tiempo-fui-ganando-seguridad-al-hablar.mp3?Expires=1794099679&Signature=qXjMpYodECyiZvMWNrNVfinf~5kaY-ijnQ5u1vYsQG14XNVhrei8yvwhsa~YERZPyhu8CqAOV4pPyUBss8FP-IR82dm4ldFAB6ofZMpRLBmrqqw7BCtY8tIV5qUrKuuKFjZ9BJpQnQr9yPOpUu0clNk6yeJlznEbkyOP2r~vU0mWbwxYCvBywKIisra6AVzfiCW9MY2cCLIQ823n~EQSYjzKAHnpE39l-3pWfhvyaaVtL99dTtxwunuuG02jFTClean0-Yp6~XVdetmSyD8I~eCSZ9CZuBIuEjPHczguvfqbHuv6g5uDzkUakqPf5RvVD0UbAEI5F01OFFEsrlSZvQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "06b7aa2f-8966-4767-8698-2ec2aa655a8f",
      "title": "Leia a explicação e repare no tipo de mudança que esse marcador sugere.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c50adfe8-51c5-4b5f-8f43-8b36ec9216a3",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Con el tiempo</strong> combina bem com progresso, adaptação e confiança que foram aparecendo aos poucos.</p><p>Ele ajuda a mostrar processo, não apenas um momento único.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2f62fc4a-3a46-4fa5-b127-9aee756f1670",
      "title": "Escute a frase e observe como ela liga a mudança anterior a uma decisão concreta.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "6204c497-1a41-4ecd-abd1-7618e192d6f8",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora aparece o passo que veio depois.</p><p><strong>A partir de ahí, me animé a buscar un trabajo bilingüe.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>A partir dali, eu criei coragem para buscar um trabalho bilingue.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/d0cbcbc98b9f4f5da696fd30eb9eb9db_l03b02-learning-timeline-realistic.png?Expires=1794099679&Signature=t6PUxdR59k-~EHD4qhRma1O4ur7eg5Wds09AESBI7G3PkXd~8X2rkPRqaR7rscbVHeGKdrgYwy7wr1x7pXtVZ5KNYUcbXRyjR9Uz~tl7vC4KFcOK8rThYqvLmXYBhPvP1Y9lg9he3C8dnF32jxziwjljs58qGS7zMDO2Si3fIhi~RW~57gamgagHHptYLVvYdbWc4He36E7BH23QY6m8VtEhW99FKnEw3OmdV59gCpr9sD64ZPrXhqmCkq4BMgH-gLkoUkTSXiWUGk9~KrIq6rp-PykY6PVif4OSPC-Mr2iHu0zPL1IgZ4lyYFfLTcuabIZIHkyk4SebETl32vLZRQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/ce88f73b30c9488c8026a40efa367380_l03b06-a-partir-de-ahi-me-anime-a-buscar-un-trabajo-bilingue.mp3?Expires=1794099679&Signature=pNmyIErE11K0eeZF-TOf9UMzPu17Pe2gbbixfbHn41QT36BmH5kOTyraXwE7riGg7PmrESiWqQ6nKQEZ0YdgRXeTIsmgqe47hchSZuYstRNHRlvtCuAKqbnAFE45k~Fa2vW6TGD4vbu~F0KaP9~qttj6CS9iUx2iOeEhC9gE8j820ZxYMmlixj8KEY1R7h94Sl1o59FR8OBzxNfKTbQr1hmICsWFAtjLlcpJHB6eXbNB0pm2obNiy7EvuMtKiJEs3BOZQnIKIBOUDciHoatpdH8g6xMLLZOdZVC3w4mUsHTckv6wm0VwN7Jcqu9XwNwAUAoPFovsgBCgHgxJc87W3g__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
